When installing packages, ALWAYS use pnpm commands:
- Use `pnpm add <package>` instead of `npm install <package>`
- Use `pnpm add -D <package>` for dev dependencies
- Use `pnpm remove <package>` instead of `npm uninstall`
- Use `pnpm install` instead of `npm install` when installing all dependencies